{"title":"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After finding the average of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c7f6c79f2148f0cec592c9517b40ee1b82ef22e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> scores, a student carelessly included the average with the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c7f6c79f2148f0cec592c9517b40ee1b82ef22e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> scores and found the \naverage of these <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> numbers. The ratio of the second average to the true average was\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/6/3a621663005223acaf309a601e0b7a6bf9dff84c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }1:1\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }35:36\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }36:35\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }2:1\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }\\text{None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"576\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c7f6c79f2148f0cec592c9517b40ee1b82ef22e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> scores are the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c7f6c79f2148f0cec592c9517b40ee1b82ef22e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> natural numbers: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/b/30b034932b50603d2d06a1c2de342c4853e822ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2, 3, \\dots 35.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"97\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>The average of the scores is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/5/b258ffeb54e7909c6dc973a45705237058ce8c64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{(35)(36)}{2}}{35} = 18.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"101\" height=\"43\" /> \n</p><p>If we add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c7f6c79f2148f0cec592c9517b40ee1b82ef22e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> numbers, the new average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/1/8b1c9ab519236a4ff93b920c0c6f6c1e13fbb6ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{648}{36} = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"73\" height=\"37\" /> still.\n</p><p>The two averages are the same, therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/1/c71bb069bfdaafb31f8a08a589cf528a621fb38c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }1:1}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"87\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>-edited by coolmath34\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME\" title=\"1971 AHSME\">1971 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1971 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1971\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1971 AHSME